# Exact diagonal subtotal of the first retained run

The first retained interval is `[0, 96]`. Its diagonal block uses 97 clipped
prices and sinc indices 0 through 193. The cached integers come from
`scripts/verify_odd_three_sine_hs.py` at blob
`b35434bed50c8a6ba218d01575e1964cae9a93e6`. Lean checks each entry against the
published literal functions and uses the original triangle weights in the
subtotal. The rectangle consumer still requires the other block contributions.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

